  @contract  re-striking a gesture pitch toggles it off; freed slots are reused lowest-first  @ 1343
  @contract  spreadChan strikes walk channels up from home; plain strikes stack home-channel lanes  @ 1344
  @invariant  pins (col,row,part); overwrites a place keep-below, steps the sub-caret right  @ 1464
  @invariant  field re-read via cells[row] each keystroke; undo snapshots drive backspace-restore  @ 1465
  @contract  target, facility and key are remembered at take tier; the rest is per invocation  @ 2364
  @contract  with no target the whole of it is the notation snap  @ 2365
  @contract  the facility reads the target as points of the pitch line or as moves between strands  @ 2366
  @contract  purity is the moves facility's alone: how nearly a spelled interval sounds pure  @ 2367
  @contract  ambient is the moves facility's alone: the share of its sonority a strand rests on  @ 2368
  @contract  returns the steps whose empty shortlists refused the solve, else nil  @ 2369
  @contract  widen stretches those windows to the nearest points instead, so none refuses  @ 2370
  @contract  selection must be exactly one grid column; multi-col selection is a no-op  @ 3168
  @invariant  a 1-col block stays contiguous when it lands on the destination col  @ 3169
  @contract  cursor follows to the destination column (single event and selection alike)  @ 3170
